Fire Totem AutoCast Fire Shield
    Events
        Unit - A unit Is attacked
        Time - Every 0.30 seconds of game time
    Conditions
        Or - Any (Conditions) are true
            Conditions
                (Owner of (Attacked unit)) Equal to Player 1 (Red)
                (Owner of (Attacked unit)) Equal to Player 2 (Blue)
        ((Attacked unit) has buff Fire Shield ) Equal to False
    Actions
        Unit Group - Pick every unit in TotemGroupNazgrekFire and do (Actions)
            Loop - Actions
                Unit - Order (Picked unit) to Orc Shaman - Lightning Shield (Attacked unit)
                Custom script:   call IssueTargetOrder (GetTriggerUnit(), "lightning shield", GetAttacker())
